    "body": "I'm kind of just adding things that would reduce redundant operations across segments. 😅 \r\n\r\nI know that we'll end up using `Context` to share user configuration across segments, and maybe a list of binaries accessible via `$PATH` (so that we don't have to call `Command::new()` when it doesn't make sense to). I don't foresee much else being added after this point.\r\n\r\nCan you think of a better way to organize `Context`?",
